  "source_issues": [
    "S5 calls the post-TFSI-exchange ethyl precipitate (Br)2; heading, drawing, reagents and elemental formula support the TFSI salt. Original wording retained in raw PDF.",
    "S8 propyl heading says N-ethyl. The propyl label, drawn structure, 1-bromopropane reagent, NMR and C34 salt formula support N-propyl; preserve this source inconsistency.",
    "S36 Table S4 repeats the ethyl/Li/MeCN formal potentials from S33. Do not count these as independent observations.",
    "S35 Table S3 contains cathodic peaks in Li(TFSI) plus 0.2 M K(TFSI). These are not additional formal-potential labels.",
    "No temperature was assigned where the source table does not provide one. Reported solubility uncertainty is not relabelled as SD/SE."
  ],
